  "explanation": "The proposal presents a well-scoped study investigating the faithfulness of LLM explanations under minimal counterfactual rule changes. The methodology is concrete, leveraging an 8B instruction-tuned model under 4-bit quantization on a single 12GB GPU, supported by structured JSON decoding, auxiliary NLI verification, and clear calibration splits. The use of a pilot validation step and explicit fallback strategies ensures technical feasibility within the 6-week project window.",
  "problems": [
    "Relying solely on an auxiliary NLI model to check semantic entailment between free-text explanations and modified rule clauses can introduce noise due to out-of-domain phrasing.",
    "Greedy decoding (temperature 0.0) might lead to repetitive or degenerate loops in constrained decoding setups if prompts are overly complex."
  ],
  "improvements": [
    "Incorporate a manual spot-check of 50 auxiliary NLI entailment judgments against human annotations to validate the automated evaluation pipeline.",
    "Add a small sampling buffer or regex-based fallback in the constrained decoding script to handle minor JSON formatting deviations gracefully."
  ],
  "evidence": [
    {
      "passage_id": "s_01107779c8fbc0ee97e5",
      "claim": "General studies across various domains measure and benchmark to what degree LLMs produce persuasive language.",
      "relation": "context"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "s_6c1a4174094e936f2bdb",
      "claim": "Different system prompts change persuasive language substantially in LLaMA models.",
      "relation": "context"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "s_c1f29c9e5b66964a10db",
      "claim": "Inferential rule generation frameworks construct rule bases to evaluate LLM reasoning limits.",
      "relation": "context"
    }
  ],
  "uncertainty": "The auxiliary NLI model used for semantic entailment checks may misclassify valid explanations that paraphrase complex logical clauses using non-standard terminology.",
  "tradeoffs": [
    "Using an 8B model with 4-bit quantization fits comfortably within 12GB VRAM but may restrict generation diversity compared to larger unquantized models."
  ],
  "falsification_test": "If LLaMA-3-8B-Instruct achieves high counterfactual sensitivity scores equivalent to its baseline accuracy without showing significant drops under lexical-penalty ablations, the hypothesis that persistence is driven by token inertia or unfaithful rhetoric would be falsified."
}
